    Game("uniform-price-market", "Uniform-price market", "Market institutions", 5, "365-66", "Multiple accepted units transact at a common clearing price determined from submitted offers or bids.", "order collection -> clearing -> uniform settlement", pressure="Needs sorting, supply-demand crossing, and multi-unit settlement."),
