    Game("third-price-auction", "Third-price sealed-bid auction", "Auctions", 7, "504, 515-17", "The highest bidder wins and pays the third-highest bid, used to probe departures from standard bidding predictions.", "sealed bids -> third order statistic -> payment", "implemented", "third-price-auction", "Order statistics are implemented; deterministic tie-breaking remains."),
