    Game("affiliated-value-auction", "Affiliated-value auction", "Auctions", 7, "517-20", "Bidder signals are correlated and informative about a common component, so public information and linkage affect bids and revenue.", "correlated private signals -> public signal -> bids", pressure="Needs declarative correlated draws and staged disclosure."),
