    Game("multiunit-auction", "Multi-unit discriminatory and uniform-price auctions", "Auctions", 5, "362-66", "Participants submit demand or supply schedules for several units; accepted units pay their own bids or a common clearing price.", "bid schedules -> rank units -> discriminatory/uniform payment", pressure="Needs structured schedules and multi-unit clearing."),

