    Game("information-market", "Information aggregation asset market", "Asset markets", 6, "447-64", "Traders receive dispersed private clues about an asset's state and trade claims whose prices may aggregate that information.", "private signals -> repeated orders/trades -> state payoff", pressure="Needs an order book, private signals, and terminal dividends."),
    Game("market-for-information", "Market for information", "Asset markets", 6, "461-64", "Traders can purchase information before or while trading, making information acquisition itself an endogenous decision.", "buy signal -> trade -> dividend", pressure="Needs purchasable capabilities and budget accounting."),
    Game("spot-futures", "Spot and futures market", "Asset markets", 6, "464-67", "Participants trade linked spot and state-contingent claims, permitting hedging and arbitrage across markets.", "parallel linked order books -> clearing -> contingent payoff", pressure="Needs multiple atomic markets and cross-market positions."),
